  "adaptations": [
    "Public value types and explicit constructors; no original app preference domain/key lookup or automatic migration",
    "New versioned JSON envelope bound to caller domain; maximum 65536 bytes; corrupt/future data throws and is preserved until explicit save",
    "Original seven pen styles use deterministic synthetic IDs; palette size/name limits bound new standalone settings",
    "Only action preferences extracted from Pencil settings file; geometric fitting and actual input handling belong to InkSpaceWritingAids or host",
    "UIKit subtitle renderer omitted; appearance data and bounds remain reusable; demo follows system light/dark appearance"
  ],
  "limitations": "这是偏好库与可启动macOS示例，不是完整InkSpace设置界面或书写引擎。iOS库支持不等于Apple Pencil硬件验收；事件、PencilKit工具、系统语言设置、原生字幕/播放/翻译/AI服务由宿主实现。没有新增全局主题或无障碍系统控制；示例跟随系统外观。原App存量偏好不会自动读取或迁移。多写者需宿主协调；本地配置不是密钥保险库。",
